          "summary": "Add Contractor IP indemnity with customary exclusions, procure/modify/replace/refund remedies and a 3x annual fees super-cap",
          "comment": "[Playbook] Section 7 is headed \"Indemnification of Contractor\" but contains no indemnity language at all, leaving us with no protection against third-party IP claims. We add a Contractor IP indemnity with the customary Company modification, combination and specification exclusions, procure/modify/replace and refund remedies, and a 3x annual fees super-cap carved out of the Section 7(a) cap, which is our fallback position.",
