              "paragraphId": "p0035",
              "oldText": "EXCEPT WITH RESPECT TO CONTRACTOR'S OBLIGATIONS PURSUANT TO PARAGRAPH 9 HEREOF",
              "newText": "EXCEPT WITH RESPECT TO CONTRACTOR'S OBLIGATIONS PURSUANT TO PARAGRAPH 9 HEREOF AND SECTION 7(d)"
            },
            {
              "kind": "insert_after",
              "paragraphId": "p0037",
              "numbering": "(d)",
              "text": "Contractor shall indemnify Company against any third-party claim alleging that the Services or the Works infringe or misappropriate any intellectual property right, except to the extent the claim arises from (i) modification of the Works by Company, (ii) combination of the Works by Company with items not supplied by Contractor, or (iii) Contractor's compliance with specifications furnished by Company. Contractor shall, at its option, procure for Company the right to continue using the affected item, or modify or replace it so that it is non-infringing, and if none of those remedies is reasonably available, refund the fees paid to Contractor for the affected item. Contractor's liability under this Section 7(d) shall not exceed three times (3x) the annual fees paid to Contractor under this Agreement."
            }
          ]
        },
